Subject: [PATCH 077/105] hc layer boundary: the measurement scripts, and what
 they said

`numerics_check.py` is the load-bearing one: it pulls real HC weights out
of the checkpoint and compares apply-then-mix against the fused prologue
for M in {1, 4, 16} x {bf16, fp8 mix weights} x {with, without the shared
fold}. `applied`, `normed` and the gate partials come back bit-identical
in all 12 cases. `mixed` differs on a few elements in 2 of 12, and
`mix_nondeterminism.py` is why that is not a finding: K1 accumulates
`t_raw` with device-scope atomics, so re-running the *same* unfused call
on the same input already differs 5 times out of 5 at M=16 bf16.

`bench_k0_prologue.py` / `bench_k0_variants.py` time the prologue in
isolation; `trace_budget.py` reads the two kernels the fold moves work
between out of a decode trace, trimming the handful of per-profile K0
launches that land in the hundreds of us (profiler artefacts that swamp a
raw sum).

Same-build flag-off vs flag-on, W4 verify step, per-step totals:

    apply2  51 -> 5 launches   64.6 -> 6.0 us   (code-edit)
                                63.8 -> 6.0 us   (prose-en)
    K0                        193.4 -> 210.4 us (code-edit)
                              194.6 -> 210.0 us (prose-en)
    net                              -41.6 / -42.4 us/step
    kernels/step (TARGET_VERIFY)   1399 -> 1353

W16, same accounting:

    apply2  63 -> 17 launches  102.9 -> 21.9 us  (code-edit)
                              101.3 -> 22.2 us  (prose-en)
    K0 (trimmed)              239.2 -> 274.3 us (code-edit)
                              237.7 -> 269.0 us (prose-en)
    net                              -45.9 / -47.8 us/step
    kernels/step (TARGET_VERIFY)   1447 -> 1401

Step wall moved by less than the run-to-run spread at both widths (+-0.2 ms
on a 9.8 / 16.7 ms step), so the kernel accounting is the honest number.

MODE=full with the flag on: acceptance W4 code 3.82-3.88 / prose-en
2.58-2.65 / agent-loop 3.10-3.34; W16 code 11.21-11.76 / prose-en
3.07-3.12 / agent-loop 5.17-5.26 -- all in band and level with the last
full run of this fork. Needle 18.5k PASS and sanity_gen PASS at both
widths.

